[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]CSS v1.0.10[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[list]
[*]Hiding a garment can now switch off its physics too. Commander White's belt stops simulating while the belt is hidden, so it costs nothing.
[*]Hand support does less work every frame on outfits whose body rig it does not bind to.
[/list]

Requires CSS Shared Assets 1.0.10.
